      "Block 3: time loop\n",
      " 11101 steps, dt = 1.30e-07 s, total time = 1.44 ms\n",
      " Progress: 0%.. 9%.. 19%.. 29%.. 39%.. 49%.. 59%.. 69%.. 79%.. 89%.. 99%.. 100% Done.\n",
